# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# --- Reproducibility -------------------------------------------------
# Flutter's generated ignore list excludes the Gradle wrapper, which
# defeats the wrapper's entire purpose: it exists so that anyone who
# clones the repo builds with the *same* pinned Gradle version, without
# installing Gradle first. Gradle's own documentation says to commit it.
# Un-ignored here so a clean clone can actually build an APK.
!gradle-wrapper.jar
!/gradlew
!/gradlew.bat
